  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a strange illusion every human carries."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1190
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They believe they know themselves."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1191
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But what they actually know is only a version."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1192
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A temporary version."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A momentary definition."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1194
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A story that keeps changing… but feels constant."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1195
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum sochte hain hum ek fixed identity hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1196
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am like this.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1197
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I don’t do that.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1198
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I always react this way.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1199
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But truth yeh hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1200
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "hum ek fixed person nahi hote."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1201
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum situations ke response mein bante hue versions hote hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1202
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek din tum confident hote ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1203
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek din tum silent ho jaate ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1204
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek din tum sab kuch samajh rahe hote ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1205
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek din tum khud ko hi nahi samajh paate."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1206
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur phir bhi tum kehte ho:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1207
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“This is me.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1208
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin kaunsa “me”?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1209
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki jo “tum” kal the…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1210
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh aaj ka tum nahi hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1211
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jo aaj ka tum hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1212
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh kal nahi rahega."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1213
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But mind ek trick karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1214
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Woh in changing moments ko ek single identity mein compress kar deta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1215
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Taaki confusion kam ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1216
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Taaki life manageable lage."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1217
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahin se ek illusion create hota hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1218
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A stable self."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1219
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum apni identity ko ek object bana dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1220
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jaise woh permanent ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1221
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jaise woh fixed ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1222
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jaise woh change nahi hota."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1223
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But reality yeh hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1224
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Self is not an object."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1225
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Self is a process."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1226
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur process ko define karna hamesha incomplete hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1227
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye hum labels use karte hain:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1228
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am introvert"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1229
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am overthinker"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1230
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am emotional"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1231
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am strong"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1232
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am broken"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1233
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But labels reality nahi hote."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1234
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Labels bas understanding ko simplify karte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1235
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jo cheez simplify hoti hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1236
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh truth lose kar deti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1237
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek aur dangerous layer hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1238
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum apne past ko apni identity bana dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1239
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jo hum the…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1240
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh hum ban jaate hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1241
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek rejection → “I am rejected type”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1242
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek failure → “I am failure prone”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1243
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek mistake → “I am wrong person”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1244
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur dheere dheere past ek mirror nahi rehta."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1245
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Past ek cage ban jaata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1246
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin agar tum genuinely observe karo…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1247
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh ek strange gap dikhega."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1248
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum wahi person nahi hote jo tum 3 saal pehle the."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1249
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na thoughts same hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1250
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na reactions same hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1251
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Na desires same hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1252
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even memories same nahi feel hoti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1253
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Phir bhi tum insist karte ho:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1254
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am the same person.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1255
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki continuity comfort deti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1256
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur comfort truth se zyada powerful hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1257
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek moment aata hai jab self breakdown start hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1258
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jab tum realize karte ho:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1259
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Main jis “self” ko defend kar raha tha…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1260
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh actually ek narrative tha."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1261
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A set of repeated thoughts."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1262
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A collection of reactions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1263
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A memory-based identity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1264
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not something solid."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1265
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahan ek uncomfortable silence aata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1266
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Agar main fixed nahi hoon…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1267
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh main hoon kya?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1268
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Yeh question scary lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1269
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki insaan ko structure chahiye hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1270
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Identity structure deti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1271
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even if it is false."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1272
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye hum apne upar stories chipka dete hain:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1273
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am like this"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1274
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am not like that"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1275
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I can’t do this"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1276
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I always do that"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1277
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur har baar jab life contradict karti hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1278
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "hum ya toh ignore kar dete hain…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1279
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "ya explanation bana dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1280
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur slowly ek cheez aur hoti hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1281
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We stop observing ourselves."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1282
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And start protecting a version of ourselves."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1283
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Self-awareness ka illusion yeh hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1284
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum sochte hain hum khud ko samajh rahe hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1285
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But actually hum ek image ko maintain kar rahe hote hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1286
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab koi experience us image ko break karta hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1287
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "hum us experience ko reject kar dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1288
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Instead of updating the image."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1289
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yeh hi loop hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1290
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reality → contradiction → denial → story repair → identity reinforcement"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1291
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But kabhi kabhi life forcefully break karti hai ye structure."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1292
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not to punish."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1293
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But to show:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1294
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum jo defend kar rahe the… woh real tha hi nahi."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1295
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahan pe pehli baar ek clarity aati hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1296
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum ek fixed self nahi ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1297
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum ek unfolding process ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1298
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jo process ko hold karne ki koshish karta hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1299
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh stress create karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1300
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because you cannot hold movement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1301
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You can only observe it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1302
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur shayad sabse deep realization yeh hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1303
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tumhe khud ko “find” nahi karna hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1304
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tumhe khud ko “stop defining” karna hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1305
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki definition ruk jaati hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1306
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin life nahi rukti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1307
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab definition kam hoti hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1308
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "tab experience zyada visible hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1309
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahi se ek shift start hota hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1310
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
